      friendship: 0
  - title: A gift for the crow
    number: 5
    heartsNeeded: 5
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I would like to give the crow a present. Not bread. Walt says crows are clever, and clever creatures are insulted by bread.
    - Corn, I think. Real corn, from a real farm. Three cobs. If he takes them, perhaps we will finally be introduced.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7131efea24ac2a7478636dc29754660a, type: 2}
      amount: 3
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: Corn for the crow
      questText: Kenji wants three cobs of Corn to give to the crow on the football field.
      reminder:
      - Corn for the crow? Three, if you have them. He is waiting. He has been waiting two years; he can wait a little more.
      thanks:
      - Beautiful. He will be very pleased, or he will pretend not to be. Either is fine.
      - I will leave them on the bench tomorrow at dawn. Thank you.
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: My brother's letters
    number: 6
    heartsNeeded: 6
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The crow took the corn. All three. He did not say thank you. But he sat on the bench afterwards, next to me, for one whole minute.
    - My brother writes from Japan every week. Emeka brings the letters. Our old house is by the sea. My brother is old too, and alone there now.
    - I have been thinking that I would like to see the sea again. And him. Before we are both too slow to sit together.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: A letter I cannot write
    number: 7
    heartsNeeded: 7
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - I have tried to tell Yuki. Three times. Each time I open my mouth, and she says something about the museum, and I say something about lunch.
    - 'I am trying to write it instead. Look: one page, and every line crossed out.'
    - My calligraphy is very good. My courage is not. It is strange to be so old and still find some things difficult.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
